{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>NOWHERE TO GO</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Buying the game only gives the base chapter 1)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nowhere to Go&quot; is a narrative-driven horror game that blends stealth, puzzles, and atmospheric exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/36adddfd346c56e2305365d46e9bfe8b.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/36adddfd346c56e2305365d46e9bfe8b.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A routine call leads you to <i>Home Forest</i>, a once-beloved theme park that now stands abandoned and forgotten. As a police officer sent to investigate a late-night disturbance, you quickly realize something is deeply wrong. What starts as a simple check spirals into a dark mystery you must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/b5fd9012346a2e5aa3be6f33aff42514.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/b5fd9012346a2e5aa3be6f33aff42514.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span>You play as a police officer sent to investigate a disturbance at Home Forest, a theme park that recently closed its gates. What starts as a simple check turns into something deeper. A mystery you must solve, you\u2019ll meet many monsters, but maybe in the depths a friendly face will meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/f221c915cb1f1718f3c607b812ec3f81.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/f221c915cb1f1718f3c607b812ec3f81.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span>Your journey will take you deep into the heart of the park, where each puzzle reveals a new piece of the truth. No two challenges are the same, and survival means staying quiet, thinking fast, and watching your back. Amid the horror, you may even find an unexpected ally\u2014someone, or something, that remembers what Home Forest used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/b92d689509d71628d518c275dac74bd1.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/b92d689509d71628d518c275dac74bd1.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span>Home Forest was once a beloved family theme park, built on the success of the hit cartoon <i>Forest Companionship</i>. The show preached kindness, friendship, and growing up together<br>But as any story goes something went wrong.<br>now it\u2019s your job to uncover what horrible experiments went on in Home Forest and defeat every monster that comes in your path.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001360?t=1771371084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/5b90c9fdb07f386653e42a5ca1958b99f2ae12d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771371084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/2623cea1fde91de9e754a877a43e2a543d17eb54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771371084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/2623cea1fde91de9e754a877a43e2a543d17eb54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771371084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>NOWHERE TO GO</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Buying the game only gives the base chapter 1)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nowhere to Go&quot; is a narrative-driven horror game that blends stealth, puzzles, and atmospheric exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/36adddfd346c56e2305365d46e9bfe8b.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/36adddfd346c56e2305365d46e9bfe8b.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A routine call leads you to <i>Home Forest</i>, a once-beloved theme park that now stands abandoned and forgotten. As a police officer sent to investigate a late-night disturbance, you quickly realize something is deeply wrong. What starts as a simple check spirals into a dark mystery you must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/b5fd9012346a2e5aa3be6f33aff42514.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/b5fd9012346a2e5aa3be6f33aff42514.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span>You play as a police officer sent to investigate a disturbance at Home Forest, a theme park that recently closed its gates. What starts as a simple check turns into something deeper. A mystery you must solve, you\u2019ll meet many monsters, but maybe in the depths a friendly face will meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/f221c915cb1f1718f3c607b812ec3f81.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/f221c915cb1f1718f3c607b812ec3f81.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span>Your journey will take you deep into the heart of the park, where each puzzle reveals a new piece of the truth. No two challenges are the same, and survival means staying quiet, thinking fast, and watching your back. Amid the horror, you may even find an unexpected ally\u2014someone, or something, that remembers what Home Forest used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras/b92d689509d71628d518c275dac74bd1.avif?t=1771371084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/extras_big/b92d689509d71628d518c275dac74bd1.avif?t=1771371084 width=1560 height=504 /></span>Home Forest was once a beloved family theme park, built on the success of the hit cartoon <i>Forest Companionship</i>. The show preached kindness, friendship, and growing up together<br>But as any story goes something went wrong.<br>now it\u2019s your job to uncover what horrible experiments went on in Home Forest and defeat every monster that comes in your path.</p>","developers":["Trinity Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001360/521e120f80de31298f82a7636bb154dc49b3f92c/header.jpg?t=1771371084","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[